{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>וי\"ו ויכלת.</b> כף with a raphe in the language of Ishmael: if you do this thing, and HaShem gives you permission to do it, then you will be able to stand. And behold, the word עמוד is the verb, like עמוד פתח האהל (Judges 4:20), and also פשטה וערה וחגורה על חלצים (Isaiah 32:11):" "And the meaning of וגם כל העם הזה is: the litigants who were standing before him — among them are some who cannot speak to you to have you judge them — and behold when they return to their tents the quarrel between them will intensify; but now each man will come to his place, which is his tent, in peace:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "I read כפ\"א as כף (the letter kaf) with a raphe, referring to the conditional particle in Arabic (ك) prefixed to תעשה."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:44.419858248Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}